### Koffy API - Categories Endpoints
### Categories are scoped within roasters
### Make sure to replace {{token}} with your actual JWT token

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@roasterId = 1

### 1. Get all categories for a roaster (PUBLIC - shows active for non-members)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get all categories with coffees included
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories?include_coffees=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get a specific category by ID (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get a specific category without coffees
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1?include_coffees=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create a new category (MEMBERS ONLY - requires edit privileges)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "name": "Espresso Blends",
    "description": "Mezclas perfectas para espresso con cuerpo y crema abundante",
    "color": "#8B4513",
    "icon": "coffee-cup",
    "position": 1,
    "is_active": true
  }
}

### 6. Create another category example - Single Origin
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "name": "Single Origin",
    "description": "Cafés de origen único que destacan las características de cada región",
    "color": "#6F4E37",
    "icon": "location-pin",
    "position": 2,
    "is_active": true
  }
}

### 7. Create category - Decaf
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "name": "Decafeinados",
    "description": "Cafés descafeinados sin comprometer el sabor",
    "color": "#A0522D",
    "icon": "moon",
    "position": 3,
    "is_active": true
  }
}

### 8. Update a category (MEMBERS ONLY - requires edit privileges)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "name": "Premium Espresso Blends",
    "description": "Mezclas premium para espresso con notas de chocolate y caramelo",
    "color": "#654321",
    "position": 1
  }
}

### 9. Deactivate a category (keep it but hide from public)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "is_active": false
  }
}

### 10. Reorder categories by changing position
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": {
    "position": 5
  }
}

### 11. Delete a category (MEMBERS ONLY - requires management privileges)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Category Fields:
### - name: String (required) - Name of the category
### - description: Text - Detailed description
### - color: String - Hex color code for UI theming
### - icon: String - Icon identifier for the category
### - position: Integer - Order in which categories are displayed
### - is_active: Boolean - Whether the category is visible to public
###

### Permission Requirements:
### Action                | Public | Member | Barista | Manager | Owner
### ---------------------|--------|--------|---------|---------|-------
### List categories      |   ✓*   |   ✓    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### View category        |   ✓*   |   ✓    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Create category      |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Update category      |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Delete category      |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✓    |   ✓
###
### * Public users only see active categories from active roasters
### * Members see all categories including inactive ones from their roaster

